{"id":"5a435dbfefa9e0ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-inner-model.md","title":"Inner Model","display":"df-inner-model — Inner Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-inner-model","aliases":["58-df-inner-model"],"display":"df-inner-model — Inner Model","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-inner-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-inner-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inner-model — Inner Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是元理论中的类变元</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)\\)</span>（可定义真类谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>（全体序数组成的类）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})\\)</span>（ZFC 公理集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\sigma\">\\((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\sigma\\)</span>（类结构的元理论满足关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S\\)</span>（作用于类变量的内模型谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}model}^{\\mathsf{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ord}\\subseteq M\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\bigl((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}model}^{\\mathsf{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ord}\\subseteq M\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\bigl((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>内模型含有全部序数；因此在环境宇宙中它不是集合。</li>\n<li>内模型可以等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，所以不应把“是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的真子类”写入定义。</li>\n<li>该定义在类元理论中读取；它不把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 作为集合编码后送入对象语言的满足谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 和 HOD 是规范内模型；forcing ground model 也是扩张宇宙中的内模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)$（可定义真类谓词，见 [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})$（ZFC 公理集，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\})","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}model}^{\\mathsf{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(M)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ord}\\subseteq M\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\bigl((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\sigma\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1409,"backlinks":[{"id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b8869305e2d6e82f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"434f0e097f1ba765","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af41b848b759f6c6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S$ is the class-level inner-model predicate from [[../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md]]; its definition includes transitivity, all ordinals, and satisfaction of ZFC."},{"id":"fec6718cf2ce4510","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S$ (inner-model predicate, see [[58-df-inner-model]])"},{"id":"31fb1fed988b718a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S$ 是作用于类变元的内模型谓词（见 [[58-df-inner-model]]）"},{"id":"b78f1aa00040ca7f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca75fae2ee31f790","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$ (possibly proper inner-model class; see [[58-df-inner-model]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-690","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md|58-df-inner-model]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["ca2a9c9166fa8cce","393515cdafde1b06"]}